v3.10 — History tab does it all

The History tab is now a fully featured analytics view, on top of an
append-only persistent archive that survives "Clear all fights".

NEW
- Persistent archive (archive.lua) keeps every fight forever
- History tab: date range presets, view mode picker, sortable columns
- Multi-select checkboxes + combine view on the History tab
- Split-pets toggle on the History tab (mirrors DPS tab)
- Copy to clipboard on the History tab — single fights or combined
- Mob filter dropdown auto-populated from your fight history
- /healtracker search <text> slash command for substring filtering
- /healtracker log shows path to permanent fight log
- Active buttons highlighted bright green
- Necro swarm pets ('s Animated Corpse) attributed to owner

FIXES
- Possessive-form pet damage parser ("Eyehop's pet" was being dropped)
- Multi-word pet/spell names in slash commands
- Tab no longer resets to Session after each fight
- Begin/End balance under errors (no more cryptic overlay pauses)
- Raid/zone PC damage now captured (not just group members)

CHANGED
- Tab order: Heals / DPS / Spells / History / Session / Settings
- Timeout fights discarded as noise instead of saved
- DPS table sorts purely by total damage
